  "text_md": "(19)\n\n(12)\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n(11)\n\nEP 499 943 B1\n\n## EUROPEAN PATENT SPECIFICATION\n\n- (45) Date of publication and mention of the grant of the patent: 20.04.2011 Bulletin 2011/16\n\n- (51) Int CI.:: GO6F 1/32(2006.01)\n\n- (86) International application number:\n\n- (21) Application number: 02757648.7\n\nPCTIUS2002/028537\n\n- (22) Date of\n\n- 04.09.2002 filing:\n\n- (87) International publication number: WO 2003/027818 (03.04.2003 Gazette 2003/14)\n\n## (54) A METHOD AND APPARATUS TO PROVIDE A USER PRIORITY MODE\n\nVERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNG ZUR BEREITSTELLUNG EINES BENUTZERPRIORITATSMODUS\n\nPROCEDE ET DISPOSITIF DONNANT UN MODE DE PRIORITE D'UTILISATEUR\n\n- (84) Designated Contracting States:\n\n(72) Inventor: STANLEY, Randy\n\nAT BE BG CH CY CZ DE DK EE ES FI FR GB GR IEIT LI LU MC NL PT SE SK TR\n\nAptos, CA 95003 (US)\n\n- (74) Representative: Goddar, Heinz J.\n\n- (30) Priority:\n\n25.09.2001 US 965283\n\nForrester &amp; Boehmert Pettenkoferstrasse 20-22 80336 Munchen (DE)\n\n- (43) Date of publication of application:\n\n26.01.2005 Bulletin 2005/04\n\n- (56) References cited:\n\n- (73) Proprietor: Intel Corporation\n\nEP-A- 0 708 398 US-A- 6 076 171\n\nUS-A- 5 396 635\n\nSanta Clara, CA 95052 (US)\n\nNote: Within nine months of the publication of the mention of the grant of the European patent in the European Patent Bulletin; any person may give notice to the European Patent Office of opposition to that patent; in accordance with the Implementing Regulations. Notice of opposition shall not be deemed to have been filed until the opposition fee has been (Art. 99(1) European Patent Convention). paid.\n\n<!-- image -->",
